+# Perf history
+
+## Real transcript ingest
+
+No measured run exists in this repository. Searched: every commit on every
+branch reachable from this worktree (`git log --all`), this worktree's
+`.muninn/` store (empty — `records/`, `compiled/`, `compact/` have no files),
+`crates/muninn-bench/` (its ingest benchmark, `ingest_200`, seeds 200
+synthetic records into a synthetic 50 000-record index — not this project's
+own transcript), and `research/00-evidence-log.md` / `research/CONCLUSION.md`
+(their `[I4]` figure, 275 ms, is the same synthetic 200-record run, not a
+real Claude Code transcript).
+
+No file in this checkout records: the transcript's size in MB, the number of
+turns or episodes it produced, or the wall-clock time of ingesting it.
+
+To fill this section, run `muninn ingest` on this project's actual
+`~/.claude/projects/.../*.jsonl` transcript and record: file size (MB),
+turn count, episode count, and elapsed time.
